summary:
MIDLAND, Mich., May 22, 2023 /PRNewswire/ -- Jim Fitterling, chairman and chief executive officer of Dow Inc. (NYSE: DOW), will participate in a fireside chat during the Bernstein 39th Annual Strategic Decisions Conference on Wednesday, May 31 at 2:30 p.m. ET. www.dow.com (PRNewsfoto/The Dow Chemical Company)

Dow invites investors to join the live webcast through its website. A replay and transcript will also be available following the event.

About Dow Dow (NYSE: DOW) combines global breadth;
